 ## Usage
 
 ```sh
-tally add 4.50 --category coffee
+tally add 4.50
+  # record an expense (negative amount = refund)
+
 tally list
+  # show the most recent entries
+
 tally report
+  # totals by category
+
+tally export [-o OUTPUT]
+  # write all entries as CSV
+
+# All commands accept --help for details
 ```
 
 Entries live in `~/.tallyho.json`. Set `TALLY_FILE` to use a different file.
